**Table Action Pattern:**
```jsx
// ✅ Good - Explicit action buttons, no row clicks
<TableRow>
  <TableCell>{item.name}</TableCell>
  <TableCell>
    <div className="flex gap-2">
      <EditButton href={route("items.edit", item.id)} />
      <DeleteButton onDelete={() => handleDelete(item.id)} />
